Ranking quality, which is the part that needed real data
prec@k = fraction of the top k predicted genes that really respond; jaccard@k is
what calling exactly k genes would score. k=30 is the official panel's regime
(organizers: 22-44 significant genes per target); k=n_real is this panel's.

  naive transfer  (base rate 0.130, n_real median 542)
